    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Thulia Ghuld",
    "summary": "If you select this [Rod of the War Forge](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.thulia-ghuld.rod-of-the-war-forge) option as your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, Ghuld can choose a friendly unit 6″ away or closer. It must be **SKITARII** or **THULIA GHULD**. After [Advancing](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), the chosen unit can still shoot and declare charges that turn. The permission expires as your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins.",
